  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 2</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="2">[Not in D]</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="2[a]" corresp="#wit-k">⁊ witena gerædnes is, þæt abbodas ⁊ abbodissan heora agen lif rihtlice fadian ⁊ eac heora heorda wislice healdan</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-k">And the decree of the councillors is, that abbots and abbesses shall order their own lives aright, and also keep their flocks with wisdom,</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und Verordnung der Witan ist, dass Äbte und Äbtissinnen ihr eigenes Leben gesetzmässig ordnen und auch ihre Heerden weise halten,</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And it is the ordinance of the witan that abbots and abbesses order their own lives lawfully and also keep their flocks wisely,</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
